OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for housing development next
OL,4,Ato M1 approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for up to 90 homes next to the M1
OL,7,Fin Leicestershire have been given the
OL,8,Fgo-ahead.
OL,10,FHarborough District Council has
OL,11,Fapproved a planning application from
OL,12,FHallam Land Management Limited to build
OL,13,Fa housing development on land south of
OL,14,FLutterworth Road.
OL,16,FAccording to planning documents, 40% of
OL,17,Fhomes in the proposed development in
OL,18,FLutterworth are classed as affordable.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
