OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for housing development next
OL,4,Ato M1 approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlanning documents submitted to the
OL,7,Fcouncil state the proposed development
OL,8,Fwould "boost the supply of housing" in
OL,9,Fthe area and contribute to "economic
OL,10,Fgrowth" through the creation of jobs
OL,11,Fduring construction.
